 knee deep in Xenos. The occasional head hissing and snapping at our robotic ankles. Even with the resistant ceramic plates, all of our machines began complaining. We retreat from the dorm hive and park our units on the sleds. I jack out to find commander Robinson standing in the pit with him one of the technicians from the science part of the ship. Erikson something or other.}
