A pod, a couple thrusters, nothing more.}{\loch
 The sled extends it's carry lugs and the carry all latches on and carries me way from the aliens. A half dozen of the controller Xenos look up as the drones streamed into the tunnel. I'm not going to say I saw intelligence, but for a moment I swear I saw the classic head shake of disgust.}
