over to the other MCM, he sits down and watches Roxxie's feed. In that moment I think he realizes likely the safest spot to be is here. Crawling on the nadir side of the ship, she makes her way to the science modules external hard point and airlock. Extending her smaller dexterous hands she manipulates the controls, when that fails, she overrides the controls and enters the airlock closing the external door behind her. Carefully she opens the inner door, to cavernous darkness. Immediately shifting to infrared, she launches a drone. The science module is a mess. Drawers ripped open, lab equipment strewn across counters and floor. It looks like it had been an ugly fight. The tech who I now knew as Eric quietly says,}
