\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
Seeing this Eric let out a moan, "No." and begins to weep. The floor is littered with the remains of the other nine scientists. The recognition software automatically counting bodies but unable to easily identify them. They'd been consumed. }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
Roxxie let out a sigh,  "All accounted for." }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
Ruvi speaks up, "Where are the Xenos then?" he asks quietly. It is a question we are all wondering.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\pagebb\ql{\loch
Chapter 11.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
Immediately Robinson gets on the tether to the MCM,}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Be advised there are possibly up to five Xenos onboard. One pale and likely four standard drones." A voice I know well, Wikowsky comes back.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Roger that, motion trackers are deployed. We sent a fire team down the main spar a half an hour ago to attempt to access the CIC and disconnect Edgar. So far, no word.\u8221\'94 }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
My only experience with somewhat sentient AI's was Alice. The fact that a four man fire team had been gone for half an hour and they weren't sending people out to look for them made think it wasn't going too well. Edgar had already depressurized the ship and apparently killed the crew in the CIC, I wondered idly what Alice might do if the mission parameters were more important than our lives.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
Roxxie speaks up, "I've got something." We turned our attention back to}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
the feed. Roxxie's rocky is holding a bulkhead hatch with long tear marks}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
in it. "Looks like they decided to get into the utility spars."}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
These damn things are clever, I'd give them that. The utility spars run the length of the ship. Tubes of durasteel full of hand holds, cables and pipes, not created for a human to stroll down but for Xenos who have a weird fetish about climbing around in tight spaces, it's perfect. Immediately my mind begins to work and worry about the ingress points to this module. I speak up, "Roxxie, see if you can get to the habitat spar and aid the other marines." }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Roger that. I'll keep you posted." comes a reply. }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
I have three rockies on the ground, one in the science lab and two more currently in the maintenance bay as well as two more as assembled spares and enough parts to probably get a half dozen more up and running.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
I look at Ruvi, "Jack in and get your rocky positioned in front of the panel to the utility access." }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
I don't even get a "yes sir" before Ruvi takes off for the pit to jack in. I can see the look on the commanders face, he'd have chewed someone out for such a lack of protocol. My module, my rules. The problem I have now is a lack access to the cameras in the habitable spars. I know they were depressurized but I didn't know what was going on. Alice breaks this train of thought.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Sir, there's a radio call coming in on the surface directed to you."}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"From who?" I asked. }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Origin unknown, triangulated to a surface transmitter six hundred and fifty meters from rocky one, the}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
message is repeating." Alice replies. }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Play it" I say. Immediately the room is filled with the voice I'd spoken to earlier.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"This message is for Hurgs. Please contact us on this frequency, }{\loch
immediately, we need help!\u8221\'94}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
Alice then says, "The message just repeats."}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Alice, what is the current location of our rockies in relation to the cave we were in earlier?" I ask. "Approximately nine hundred and fifty meters." it replies. I'd been ejected as the carry all had lifted}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
off, I didn't actually know where my rocky was. I drop into my cradle and initiate a fast jack as it's called.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
I find myself on the sled on a low plateau, the storm in the north seems even angrier than the last time I'd jacked in. Because of the fast jack, not everything is fully synced up yet. Details are still filling in. Waves of rain lash across the sensor bulb. Ironically this rocky literally has everything, but lacks wipers, blowers or sonics to keep the rain off. I bring the radio online and boost its power to the max. I also configure the channels so that my audio will bounce into the meeting room.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"This is Hurgs responding." I watch as a timer ticks. Thirty seconds elapse. }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"I repeat this is PFC cyper specialist Hurgs." Then I hear it, a faint crackle, then the power boosts up. "Hurgs, we hear you. What have you guys done? The drones have gone crazy!" the voice says}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
faintly. }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Sir, please explain." I say. }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"After our last message, I called the controllers to clean up the the mess you made with your robots.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
Things went normally, then suddenly the controllers stopped responding to our commands. Drones attempted to breach our compounds. We've stayed secure but we've lost contact with the beta site and the main habitat site." In my ear I hear Janice on a side channel, "I don't think any of this is a coincidence." I agree. The mentioning of project X1243, the sudden sprouting of the antenna, the weird behavior of Edgar, the drones, the controllers, the opened confinement cell and the smashed eggs. "Okay. I'm about a klick away from the entrance to your tunnel, do you need me to clean that tunnel out?" I ask. }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"No currently there only a handful of drones and a single controller. Once they were unable}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
to breach our defenses they left." the voice replies. }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"We found the location of the beta site, where is the location of your main habitat compound?" At this there is a pause, I'm sure there are others in the background likely not that excited to give away such a vital piece of intel. To me, this pause seems crazy.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
I open a side channel to the main room with the commander.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Robinson, should I let them know about what's going on the De}{\loch
B}{\loch
e?" I ask.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
A pause at our end this time.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"No. We don't know these people or their capabilities. I have no reason to trust these people. This guy,}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
who I should remind you hasn't told us his name, said a magic word that managed to fuck us up and get more than a couple marines killed." came the response. I had to grudgingly agree with the commander. Shit truly had gone sideways once he said the project name. On the other hand it looked like his goose was getting cooked as well. }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Okay Hurgs, the main habitat is about 250km north of this current location at the base of a formation we call "Hadley's chin." Immediately Alice brings up a topo map and it was clear why they called it that. A prominence of rock, wide and square.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"I see it on the topo map. There's serious storm brewing though." I reply.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Yes. The queens crown we call it. A product of the original detonation, the storm has been raging for a couple of decades, we're now in the season when it really ramps up. Between it and the Xeno's it's why we ended up under ground. Hurgs, you asked before, the names Zeigler." comes a reply.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Glad to finally put a name to the voice, I'm going to investigate the beta site and we'll get people to the habitat." I say.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Thanks. Keep me posted." he replies. At that the comm channel goes dead.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Alice, please plot a course to the beta site, let me know when rocky one is five hundred meters out." I say. "Roger that. Course plotted. ETA nineteen minutes. My mind registers that is a steady fifty six point eight kilometers an hour. Gotta love implants! I eject from the cradle, climb out of the pit and head back to the conference room.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
