The plan almost works. Some of the Xenos must have seen the play before others seemed confused. The three rockys drop out of the sky, their retros firing fifteen meters above the ground. Dozens of Xenos caught in the rocket down wash explode as their blood flash boils. The con of being vacuum tight. Better prepared for what is ahead their Rocky's are kitted up to kill.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Too bad we have to save these civi's. Now that we've got the DeBe's guns}
