"We know the drill, let's clear a path to the entrance." to make the point I continue to maneuver my sled closer. Pinched in from four sides, the Xeno's throw themselves at our rocky's. A trio of forty millimeter grenades sends the largest of the queens to hell. Janice manages to shred the other queen. The controller Xeno's spread out and make themselves scarce. I give Alice the priority to target them in particular. Alice at this point shows her true AI power. Targeting and dropping Xeno's with blinding efficiency, all four of our rocky's dump grenade and ten mil HE rounds as we move towards the entrance. }{\loch
Realizing it\u8217\'92s turning into a rout, suddenly the Xeno\u8217\'92s turn tail and flee from the rocky\u8217\'92s.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
"Save ammo. Only fire on drones that come inside a ten meter exclusion}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
zone." Everybody acknowledges this. It doesn't take long before battle lines are drawn.}
