Much like the Beta site, high tech lab equipment punctuated by macabre experiments are everywhere. More twisted hybrids. A Xeno float in tanks with six arms. Drones a mix of some draft animal}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
and Xeno DNA lay dead in pens. Through the link I can feel Janice's disgust. I know that Marco would have been entirely too distracted by the experiments. We get to the junction and head right and come face to face with a controller Xeno. Janice's vibrablade cleaves the Xeno diagonally with a single slice. From there it's a wall to wall shooting gallery. The Xeno's attempt to box us in as more come from the other left hallway. Focusing ahead on the door, I ask Alice to take care of them. Targeted shots drop the first row, the second row stop at the junction and simply snarl. I'm down to fifty seven ten mil rounds and three forty mil grenades.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\loch
