\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
I nod at her and it simplifies. \u8220\'93Let\u8217\'92s imagine they figured out the reactor and the engines are near hundred percent efficient. Best scenario, they manage to reach low orbit, but they\u8217\'92ll have trouble maintaining it. }{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
That reactor is designed to deliver bursts of power for a rail gun, not sustained power. They don\u8217\'92t know that. I suspect they plugged in and hit the throttles.}
