\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0
\u8220\'93}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
They must have realized that reactor isn\u8217\'92t as grand at they thought and they\u8217\'92re mucking with it.\u8221\'94 laughs Janice.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0
\u8220\'93}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
I hope they have luck, at least out into high orbit.\u8221\'94 I laugh.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
