\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0
\u8220\'93}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
I guess they upped their jamming game.\u8221\'94 I note.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0
\u8220\'93}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
Guys, I know this is interesting, but we\u8217\'92ve got an immediate problem about a hundred meters above us..\u8221\'94 Fisher notes.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
This brings me back to the present. }{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
Too much going on all at the same time. The Xeno\u8217\'92s had made it to the elevator, but weren\u8217\'92t quite sure what to do. The ground here was too hard to put in any }{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
kind}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
 of emplacements. }{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
Even adding lag bolts had been frustrating. Asking Ziegler, he\u8217\'92d explained they needed to use a high power laser to make the shaft and the tunnels.}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
 }
