rip up and}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
 smash everything. }{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
As a parting gift Fisher detonate}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
s}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
 the charge under the fuel processor, vaporizing a couple dozen drones.}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
 Soon they found the stone and began dragging it from off the top of the elevator shaft, }{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
only to be presented with the same impossibly hard material covering the opening.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0
\u8220\'93}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
Ziegler, can they get into the shaft?\u8221\'94 I ask.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0
\u8220\'93}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
The material is incredibly hard and the gap is perfectly machined, so under ordinary circumstances, I\u8217\'92d say no, but these aren\u8217\'92t ordinary circumstances.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0
\u8220\'93}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
