\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
Ziegler, despite the clear disdain both him and Joanne have for each other comes over to the holotable.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0
\u8220\'93}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
They lack the tunneling equipment we have. Their claws aren\u8217\'92t strong enough to dig into it. I haven\u8217\'92t tested their acid blood against it, but based on it\u8217\'92s properties, I\u8217\'92ll guess it\u8217\'92s rather resistant. Maybe they\u8217\'92ve got other aces up their sleeves, but I think the answer is to look for other ways in.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0
\u8220\'93}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
Which are?\u8221\'94 I ask.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
Joanne manipulates the holotable. \u8220\'93We are here. There\u8217\'92s another elevator to the north, but it hasn\u8217\'92t been used in a couple years and is likely covered in several meters of dirt. The bigger entrance is to the east, a standard }{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
five meter by five meter entrance that leads down to a main junction point. It\u8217\'92s a large durasteel door with a plug of this material on the outside, the whole thing weighs nearly a hundred tons and takes more than ten minutes to open.\u8221\'94}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
Wikowsky nods as she goes through her spiel. \u8220\'93How else can they get in? How did they get in before?\u8221\'94}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
To this, she looks at Ziegler.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
