our time on Acheron,}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
 I\u8217\'92ve seen Elizabeth grown from a young girl into what could best be described as a feisty teenager. }{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
During that time she\u8217\'92d grown nearly a half meter and put on nearly fourty kilos of muscle. }{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
I asked Ziegler about what her lifespan might be or when she might come to maturity and he just shrugs. It\u8217\'92s clear he loves her, but she\u8217\'92s also an experiment, like everything else, }{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
I suspect he\u8217\'92d vivisect her in a moment if he thought there might be benefit in it for himself. Though seeing her move gear around, I think he\u8217\'92d have to ambush her at this point. The marines had been sparing with her and teaching her. While unable to hold her own against the bigger marines like Wikowsky, her and I were a pretty even match. I suspect if her and Ziegler ever got into a physical fight the training plus her biomechanical muscles would make short work of him.}
