s Elizabeth is explaining all of this, I\u8217\'92m watching the holotable. She\u8217\'92s cagey, I\u8217\'92ll give her that. I see t}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
h}{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
e alien ship push it\u8217\'92s engines a bit and then back off, closing the distance, }{\rtlch\ai0 \ltrch\loch\i0\loch
