I climb into the cockpit to see an impressive number of red lights.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0\ab0 \ltrch\loch\i0\b0
\u8220\'93}{\rtlch\ai0\ab0 \ltrch\loch\i0\b0\loch
Can\u8217\'92t we flush them with water?\u8221\'94 I ask.}
