\u8220\'93}{\rtlch\ai0\ab0 \ltrch\loch\i0\b0\loch
Not while flying.\u8221\'94 she grits back at me.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0\ab0 \ltrch\loch\i0\b0
\u8220\'93}{\rtlch\ai0\ab0 \ltrch\loch\i0\b0\loch
Alice, give me some options!\u8221\'94}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\aspalpha\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af5\langfe2052\ql{\rtlch\ai0\ab0 \ltrch\loch\i0\b0\loch
Immediately the HUDs in the cockpit start showing possible landing locations. We need to keep this ship flying for at least an hour to get back to Hadley\u8217\'92s chin.}
