Ivan\u8217\'92s wife and their kid. I can understand. He told them he was going off to govern a paradise and she found herself underground eating mushrooms fighting for scraps surrounded by monsters. Honestly, I thought Joanne might want one of the spots, but she\u8217\'92s a second generation settler. When I mentioned she had first pick she just laughed. She\u8217\'92d only every known Acheron. The idea of a dirty crowded Earth sounded entirely unappealing to her.}{\rtlch\ai0\ab0 \ltrch\loch\i0\b0\loch
 }{\rtlch\ai0\ab0 \ltrch\loch\i0\b0\loch
